* Precision 7.05V Reference Subsystem
* ADR1399H buried-Zener reference (heated) + LTC6078 unity-gain buffer
* Primary input node: IN     Primary output node: OUT
*------------------------------------------------------------------

*** Supply ***
V1 IN 0 DC 15

*** Reference bias network ***
* Zener operating current ~ (15 - 7.05) / 3.9k  ~ 2 mA
R1 IN VZ 3.9k

*** Genuine ADR1399H reference macromodel ***
* Node order: CATHODE  ANODE  HEATER+  HEATER-
XREF VZ 0 IN 0 ADR1399H

* Light noise filtering on the reference node (high-Z, buffer follows)
CF VZ 0 1u

*** LTC6078 unity-gain buffer (low impedance VREF output) ***
* Node order: IN+  IN-  V+  V-  OUT
XU1 VZ OUT IN 0 OUT LTC6078
RISO OUT OUT 0.001

*** 1 k load on the buffered reference output ***
RL OUT 0 1k

*------------------------------------------------------------------
*** Models / libraries ***
.include ADR1399H.lib
.lib LTC6078.lib

*** Analysis ***
.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7 gmin=1e-12 abstol=1e-12 reltol=1e-4
.tran 0 100m 0 10u startup

*** Measurement of settled DC output ***
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 90m TO 100m
.meas TRAN vref_raw AVG V(VZ) FROM 90m TO 100m
.meas TRAN iload AVG I(RL) FROM 90m TO 100m

.end
